ssets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rupert</strong> uses <strong>switches</strong> and <strong>mechanisms</strong> to solve puzzles, <strong>activate traps</strong>, and clear obstacles along his path. Every interaction brings him closer to completing his deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7fb7fd44053eb878f0a2f55c583d08a4.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must carefully navigate and strategize to face or avoid <strong>powerful bosses</strong> and <strong>minibosses</strong>. One wrong move can trigger dangerous foes, testing your reflexes and tactical skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/42fc8e7b7d0d7dfcb5d985e4b0b58b67.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an interactive <strong>world map</strong> where players can drive Rupert\u2019s vehicle to explore new areas, <strong>unlock missions</strong>, and discover secrets. The map is inspired by a similar system seen in <strong>Cuphead</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/668398e8fcaf116995e3e9d1a3d42c7a.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the map, <strong>upgrade your vehicle</strong>, and make crucial calls to characters like your <strong>boss</strong>. This <strong>handy device</strong> is your all-in-one tool for survival and <strong>strategic planning</strong> in the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/bc2142da38babdf186cff5b258673186.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/6deedfbec5301679600c9815fac29f5d.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/6deedfbec5301679600c9815fac29f5d.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/6deedfbec5301679600c9815fac29f5d.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your step!</strong> Rupert\u2019s journey is full of danger, where one wrong move can lead to death. From delivering packages to the devil in <strong>hell</strong> to surviving bizarre, post-apocalyptic landscapes, every location offers unexpected challenges with a touch of <strong>humor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/a99b67e1ddc0901ff92095899e380167.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 /></span></p>",
